The `14p5-0add-10deg-200s-N2-1500s` condition (polymer_wt=14.5, bath_temp=10, mixing_temp=45, pullcast_speed=7, coupon_to_bath_wait_time=200, nips_bath_wait_time=1500) has **4 independent synthesis runs** with consistent results:
